    /// The Amazon Resource Name (ARN) of the service-linked role that the Auto Scaling group uses to call other Amazon Web Services service on your behalf. By default, Amazon EC2 Auto Scaling uses a ser- vice-linked role named AWSServiceRoleForAutoScaling , which it cre- ates if it does not exist. For more information, see Service-linked roles in the Amazon EC2 Auto Scaling User Guide . Constraints: o min: 1 o max: 1600 o pattern: [\u0020-\uD7FF\uE000-\uFFFD\uD800\uDC00-\uDBFF\uDFFF\r\n\t]*
